        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Say I have groups D, C, B, A in descending order of priority.\n> \n> I would expect the lines to be:\n> ...\n> B C D\n\nAs step 4 is performed in the order of D->C->B->A (as it is the result of step 3) it results into statusline string `D C B`, as the step 4.v is \"... add the string to the status line string ...\". There needs to be an extra step of converting `D C B` into `B C D` based on the prior knowledge that \"display order\" is A->B->C->D. It can probably be something better than plain extra sort, but still requires an extra step of this reconstruction.\n",
